                            	  5772: _L_z05_UpdateDoors_LoopTransferRec:
                            	  5773:     ; Copy [06] to [04] for the call to write tiles below.
                            	  5774:     ; We need to remember how many tiles need to be copied
                            	  5775:     ; in each transfer record.
