02:0004B1C1 DD
02:0004B1C2 00
02:0004B1C3 F0
                            	  4095: 
                            	  4096: ; Params:
                            	  4097: ; [0E]: $FF, if blocked by a door
                            	  4098: ; [0F]: movement direction
                            	  4099: ;
                            	  4100: ; Returns:
                            	  4101: ; [0F]: untouched, or changed if blocked or need to change
                            	  4102: ;
                            	  4103: ; Summary:
                            	  4104: ;
                            	  4105: ; For the player: if at a doorway or walkable tile, check the screen edge.
                            	  4106: ; Then allow movement or go to the next room. Otherwise,
                            	  4107: ; check passive tile objects and stop moving.
                            	  4108: ;
                            	  4109: ; For other objects: First, if moving, test the colliding tile for
                            	  4110: ; walkability. Otherwise search for a walkable direction starting
                            	  4111: ; from input direction.
                            	  4112: ;
                            	  4113: ; When you find a walkable direction, see if it makes the object
                            	  4114: ; cross a boundary. If it doesn't, then make this direction
                            	  4115: ; the objection direction. Otherwise, keep looping.
                            	  4116: ;
                            	  4117: ; If no walkable direction is found, then stop moving.
                            	  4118: ;
                            	  4119: ;
                            	  4120: ; if is player
                            	  4121: ;   if at doorway
                            	  4122: ;     go handle a walkable direction
                            	  4123: ;   if blocked by door
                            	  4124: ;     return
                            	  4125: ;
                            	  4126:     even
